  "notes": "{後援|こうえん} refers to backing or sponsorship, typically by an organization, company, or influential person.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {後援|こうえん}{会|かい}: support group, fan club (especially for politicians)\n- {後援|こうえん}する: to sponsor, to back\n- {後援|こうえん}{団体|だんたい}: sponsoring organization\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {後援|こうえん}: backing, sponsorship (institutional, from behind the scenes)\n- {支援|しえん}: support, assistance (broader, includes direct help)\n- {援助|えんじょ}: aid, assistance (often financial or material)\n- {協賛|きょうさん}: co-sponsorship (listed alongside organizers)\n\nUSAGE:\nOn event posters and flyers in Japan, {後援|こうえん} commonly appears in the credits section, listing organizations that provided backing.",
